{"title":"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is an acute angle and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/7/5175ab3c03e43a5024bc1157cc289984782af1cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin \\frac12 \\theta = \\sqrt{\\frac{x-1}{2x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"135\" height=\"43\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/7/567744e2ef4f7e63710dfcaa23fb8f836c352a9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan \\theta$\" width=\"38\" height=\"13\" /> equals \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/8/6b8cb1b50413b7de16827ca17ca235b7689a3607.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ x \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac1{x} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{x-1}}{x+1} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{x^2-1}}{x} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\sqrt{x^2-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"522\" height=\"42\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/1/571de0514be36f1c25b3acd08726e4dfc9eb3caa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{\\theta}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"9\" height=\"21\" /> is acute and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/7/8f74820273f3c36f16284310f68151601e4d69fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos \\tfrac{\\theta}{2} = \\sqrt{1 - \\sin (\\tfrac{\\theta}{2})^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/4/e74ed5391f2c7d2bf35d7c838a899f361fdd72ca.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos \\frac{\\theta}{2} = \\sqrt{1 - (\\frac{x-1}{2x})}\\]\" width=\"173\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/0/630ecafc4d580ecc6b8540ff9a0c2f91fda538a1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos \\frac{\\theta}{2} = \\sqrt{\\frac{x+1}{2x}}\\]\" width=\"128\" height=\"43\" />\nUsing the definition of tangent,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/9/f896955e492f95358db2c5d172179d30c03951d9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\tan \\frac{\\theta}{2} = \\sqrt{\\frac{x-1}{2x}} \\div \\sqrt{\\frac{x+1}{2x}}\\]\" width=\"216\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/5/f35c3556e4853ebc22d56318ad16ab822ddce6f4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\tan \\frac{\\theta}{2} = \\sqrt{\\frac{x-1}{x+1}}\\]\" width=\"130\" height=\"43\" />\nFinally, by using the Double Angle Identity for Tangent,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/0/70007e0d4ea11b750ba724f5421e644ec795d388.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\tan \\theta = \\frac{2 \\cdot \\sqrt{\\frac{x-1}{x+1}}}{1 - \\frac{x-1}{x+1}}\\]\" width=\"133\" height=\"59\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/e/60e30e074a70e490c663495899f6b9651cd8ee2d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\tan \\theta = \\frac{\\frac{2\\sqrt{x^2-1}}{x+1}}{\\frac{2}{x+1}}\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"53\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/d/99d8113a25a9ad0ae492f11ffd6c564e5b0010c5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\tan \\theta = \\sqrt{x^2-1}\\]\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME\" title=\"1973 AHSME\">1973 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1973 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1973\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\"